Rename this file to exactly  CNAME  (no extension) and put ONLY your domain in it,
on one line, with no https:// and no trailing slash. For example:

suncoastsitters.com

Then in your domain registrar's DNS settings, add these records:

  Type   Name   Value
  A      @      185.199.108.153
  A      @      185.199.109.153
  A      @      185.199.110.153
  A      @      185.199.111.153
  CNAME  www    YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME.github.io

DNS can take up to 24 hours. Once it resolves, go to Settings → Pages in GitHub
and tick "Enforce HTTPS".

If you are not using a custom domain yet, just delete this file.
